cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "imuRUN: Routine-Use Notebooks for 'imuGAP'"
abstract: >-
  Routine-Use Notebooks ('imuRUN') is a spreadsheet-first front-end to the
  imuGAP model-fitting package. Reads model inputs (observations, locations,
  and target partitions) from a directory of CSV or RDS files or from a single
  xlsx workbook, validates them against the canonical imuGAP schema, runs a
  fit, and writes the result out. Helper functions are exported so they can be
  used directly from R as well as from the bundled command-line script.
type: software
version: "0.1.0"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/ACCIDDA/imuRUN"
